1788396903453,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":103873},{"id":1788479768218,"text":"他们俩也想把女主杀死，但是想到上一世的屈辱","sender":"me","time":"08:55","timestamp":1788396912738,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":103874},{"id":1788479768219,"text":"他把女主留了下来当自己的徒弟","sender":"me","time":"08:55","timestamp":1788396917062,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":103875},{"id":1788479768220,"text":"但是由于女主是个傻子。","sender":"me","time":"08:55","timestamp":1788396921034,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":103876},{"id":1788479768221,"text":"特别笨，什么都教不好。","sender":"me","time":"08:55","timestamp":1788396927126,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":103877},{"id":1788479768222,"text":"他就老是欺负女主。","sender":"me","time":"08:55","timestamp":1788396930820,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":103878},{"id":1788479768223,"text":"然后女主的思维就很简单，男主虽然凶，但是实际上对她很好","sender":"me","time":"08:55","timestamp":1788396948600,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":103879},{"id":1788479768224,"text":"所以女主喜欢男主","sender":"me","time":"08:55","timestamp":1788396951781,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":103880},{"id":1788479768225,"text":"他根本就不知道喜欢是什么，但是他就是不想离开男主","sender":"me","time":"08:55","timestamp":1788396959079,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1773229083171_f7agvz9zq","characterId":"aae5161b-9667-424a-95ac-e7041c6f700e","_id":103881},{"id":1788479768226,"text":"然后男主不知道为什么还经常会回忆起上一世的记忆","sender":"me","time":"08:56","timestamp